# Seed template for homelab/tle-dev/data (Vault KV v2).
#
# Copy to .env.tle-dev-data (gitignored, never committed) ONLY to override
# a generated password (e.g. to match an already-provisioned database).
# Normally this file is unnecessary: configure-vault.sh generates all
# three alphanumeric passwords itself (alphanumeric only, because they are
# composed into postgres:// URLs by ../../config/vault-secrets.yaml,
# where a / or @ would break parsing far from the cause).
# Push with: ./seed-tle-dev-vault.sh
#
# One password per role; the postgres-job sets each role from its own key.
password=
metadata_password=
quest_password=
